@startuml
[*] --> Waiting for new sale
:Customer selects an item:;
Waiting for new sale --> Adding items
:All items have been added:;
Adding items --> Payment processing
:Payment method is cash:;
Payment processing --> Sale completed
:Payment method is card or check:;
Payment processing --> Verification of payment
:Payment is approved:;
Verification of payment --> Sale completed

:Customer cancels the sale during payment processing:;
Payment processing --> Waiting for new sale

@enduml
